---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Supplier Risk Intelligence Platform">
  <section class="hero shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">EXPLAINABLE AI · SUPPLIER RISK · PORTFOLIO DEMO</p>
    <h1>Trace supplier risk from signal to source.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      A production-shaped reference implementation combining XGBoost risk scoring, hybrid document retrieval and citation-bound conclusions—using only synthetic data and fictional evidence.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/demo">Run the live demo</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/architecture">View architecture</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell grid three" aria-label="System capabilities">
    <article class="card">
      <span class="step">01</span>
      <h2>Quantitative risk</h2>
      <p>A versioned XGBoost model scores eight point-in-time signals and exposes local feature contributions.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <span class="step">02</span>
      <h2>Evidence retrieval</h2>
      <p>Dense and lexical retrieval ranks fictional supplier documents with source quality and temporal decay.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <span class="step">03</span>
      <h2>Auditable conclusion</h2>
      <p>A versioned fusion policy combines both signals; every document claim resolves to returned evidence.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
